{
    "title": "Cat\u00ae Central",
    "description": "Track your real-time order status from your homepage\r\n\r\nCat Central is a single source of maintenance and support information with abilities to search, find and purchase genuine Cat parts. Download Cat\u2019s efficient, on-the-go experience that makes Cat assets easier to operate and maintain. Scan and link your assets to the app and access personalized information tailored to your needs. Find the asset information and parts you need to make managing your assets even easier with the Cat Central app.\r\n \r\nFIND PARTS\r\nSearch, find and purchase parts specific to your assets.\r\nExplore parts easily with smart and intuitive navigation.\r\nGet quick visibility into local pricing and in-stock availability.\r\nOrder from and contact your local Cat dealer directly.\r\nImmediately access information tailored to your assets via QR code scan.\r\n \r\nGET SUPPORT\r\nAccess 24/7 support from a parts specialist whenever you need it.\r\nInput Cat serial numbers to access specific asset parts.\r\nConnect and talk with a local Cat dealer with ease.\r\nFind the right part for your assets with the Verified Fit indicator.\r\n \r\nACCESS RESOURCES\r\nUnlock a robust experience with public access to asset-specific resources and parts.\r\nPlan for future maintenance with customized recommendations.\r\nOnboard seamlessly to other Cat apps.\r\nAccess warranty information, rewards programs, Cat Financial and more.\r\nUtilize Cat Central in the ways that best fit your business.",
